WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.180
Ana Ruiz: Thanks for making time, Marcus. Priya, good to meet you properly.

2
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:17.220
Marcus Okafor: Likewise. We've been looking forward to this. The driver app is the thing our drivers complain about most.

3
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:25.880
Priya Shah: Honestly, the onboarding flow alone loses us about a third of new drivers in their first week.

4
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:36.060
Ana Ruiz: That matches what we saw in the teardown. So the plan we sketched is onboarding, route view and proof of delivery.

5
00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.920
Marcus Okafor: Yes, those three. Eight weeks feels right.

6
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:49.200
Ana Ruiz: Eight weeks works for us. On fees, we said forty-eight thousand dollars for the whole thing.

7
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.720
Marcus Okafor: Forty-eight is fine. Can we do half up front and the rest at handover?

8
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.420
Ana Ruiz: That's what we'd suggest anyway.

9
00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:10.840
Priya Shah: One thing from finance. They pay everything on net thirty. Could the second half be thirty days after handover?

10
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.540
Ana Ruiz: Net thirty is fine for us.

11
00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:22.300
Marcus Okafor: Great. On ownership, we need to own the designs. It's our product.

12
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:35.140
Ana Ruiz: Of course. Once you've paid in full, the final designs are yours. We just keep our own tools, templates and component library, because we use those for everyone.

13
00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:39.840
Marcus Okafor: Totally fair.

14
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:47.740
Ana Ruiz: And we'd love to show the work in our portfolio once the app is public.

15
00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:52.600
Marcus Okafor: Once it's live, sure. Not before launch.

16
00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.300
Ana Ruiz: Agreed, not before launch.

17
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.440
Marcus Okafor: Should we talk about exclusivity? I'm guessing you work with other logistics companies.

18
00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:10.820
Ana Ruiz: We do. We have one other client in delivery right now.

19
00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:19.100
Marcus Okafor: That's fine with us. We're not asking for exclusivity. We just don't want our stuff shared.

20
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.720
Ana Ruiz: Nothing of yours leaves the studio. Confidentiality both ways?

21
00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.960
Marcus Okafor: Both ways, and keep it simple. One paragraph.

22
00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:37.100
Priya Shah: Can we add the shift handover screen? It's small, but drivers hate it.

23
00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:47.280
Ana Ruiz: If it's one screen and a couple of states, we can fold it in without changing the fee or the timeline.

24
00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.980
Marcus Okafor: Then let's add it. Four flows.

25
00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.600
Ana Ruiz: Four flows. Priya, will you be our day-to-day contact?

26
00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.840
Priya Shah: Yes, I'll be the contact on our side.

27
00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:08.080
Ana Ruiz: And I'll send a progress update every Friday.

28
00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:14.080
Marcus Okafor: What happens if it isn't working out, on either side?

29
00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:24.260
Ana Ruiz: Either of us can end it with two weeks' notice, and you pay for the work done up to that point.

30
00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.960
Marcus Okafor: Fair, and that goes both ways.

31
00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:33.660
Priya Shah: Do we need anything on liability?

32
00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:39.280
Marcus Okafor: I'd say cap it at the fee. That's standard.

33
00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:46.420
Ana Ruiz: Capped at the fees paid, and nobody's on the hook for indirect losses.

34
00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:56.600
Marcus Okafor: Good. And after the eight weeks, if we want more, we'll just do a new statement of work. No auto-renewal, please.

35
00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:08.300
Ana Ruiz: No auto-renewal. Anything after this is a new conversation. I'll have my agent turn this into a proper agreement. Standard boilerplate is fine with you?

36
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.920
Marcus Okafor: Standard boilerplate, nothing exotic. Governing law, notices, the usual.

37
00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:21.060
Ana Ruiz: I'll send a short draft tonight. Nothing in it we haven't said today.

38
00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:27.440
Marcus Okafor: Perfect. Honestly, this is the easiest negotiation we've had all year.

39
00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.140
Ana Ruiz: Let's keep it that way.

40
00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.840
Priya Shah: Talk Friday.
